<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's INE to issue March CPI data on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Portugal's INE to issue March CPI data on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's National Statistics Institute (INE) will issue the consumer price index (CPI) for March on Tuesday, April 8, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman gave no time for the release.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
